# QUI-001 — things that must never reach the repository (CLAUDE.md §6, §8).
# Model weights: fetched by a documented script in /tools, never stored.
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.aar
*.bin
# Generated audio and its caches. A reader's synthesised audio stays on their device.
*.wav
*.pcm
*.opus
*.mp3
audio-cache/
# Books. The ticket asked for .epub over 1 MB; a size rule cannot be expressed here, and
# §8 forbids committing book files at any size, so the stricter rule is the correct one.
# Fixtures are generated from labelled TSVs (spike/indexer), not stored as books.
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw3
# Built indexes are derived from committed fixtures — regenerate, do not store.
*.db

__pycache__/
